<title>USA: Eagle Hardware Q1 May 2 net increases.</title>
<headline>Eagle Hardware Q1 May 2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>RENTON, Wash. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	  1996</p>
<p>Net sales				    $221,107    $161,106</p>
<p>Preopening expenses			   2,089	     0</p>
<p>Net income				     $4,588	$2,964</p>
<p>Net income per share			  $0.16	 $0.13</p>
<p>(000, except store week and per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended May 2 vs April 26.  </p>
<p>Eagle Hardware &amp; Garden Inc said net income for the first quarter of 1997 included the effect of $2.1 million ($0.05 per share after tax) in preopening costs, compared to no preopening costs in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it had 26 percent more common and common equivalent shares outstanding during the first quarter of 1997, primarily as a result of a 5.75 million share offering completed in September 1996.</p>
</text>
